@misc{hooks-bar-fires-the-unrunnable-warrant-evidence-names-members-not-a-count,
  section = {bar-fires},
  title   = {The unrunnable-warrant evidence names members, not a count},
  note    = {An arm's failure text is prose that ships, and it is read exactly when someone is
            deciding what went wrong, so a truncation or a bare count there withholds the finding
            at the moment it is wanted. The sibling arm's evidence was repaired to print every
            unrunnable warrant rather than a five-element slice, and that repair was verified by
            breaking the predicate and READING the output, which is the same unverified-by-program
            step as counting a list by eye. Nothing asserted the property, so an edit restoring the
            slice, or replacing the list with a confident all-N summary, would have passed every
            other arm in the file. A peer measured the general form and it is worse than skipping
            the check: their mutation grid forces the red path twenty-eight times, so the rewritten
            prose executed twenty-eight times while every arm asserted only the boolean, and an arm
            that runs the evidence without reading it reads as coverage. The message is read from
            the abstract syntax tree rather than the source text, because two textual cuts failed
            first and each failed differently: splitting on the evidence sentence was ambiguous,
            since the sentence appears both in the evidence and in the arm's own docstring quoting
            it, so a cut taking the first occurrence would have measured its own prose; anchoring
            on the format-string prefix then made the marker unique by matching the wrong
            occurrence, because the target's literal is split across adjacent fragments that no
            substring spans. The tree joins those fragments into the node the compiler sees, which
            is the object the claim is about. Four arms measured, and the fourth passed at first
            because a line-addressed substitution aimed two lines off the target matched nothing
            and exited zero: a green falsification arm is ambiguous between a hole in the arm and a
            plant that never landed, and the second is silent by construction.},
  check   = {cmd:.venv/bin/python3 -m pytest tests/test_bar_fires.py -k test_the_unrunnable_warrant_evidence_names_members_not_a_count}
}

